Added Objective-C language support (`objc`, alpha): tree-sitter based parsing of `.m` files with semgrep pattern syntax (metavariables, ellipsis in argument/statement/message-keyword positions, deep ellipsis), enabling search-mode and taint-mode rules on Objective-C code. Message sends, blocks, control flow, class/method definitions, and Objective-C literals are modeled; remaining constructs parse and degrade gracefully. Objective-C++ (`.mm`) support will follow separately.
